  "notes": "Warm parchment palette (cream surfaces on beige) with a single rust accent (#b5532b) for selected radio cards, on-switches and active tab underline; near-black primary buttons. Serif headings give a bookish, artisanal feel. Distinctive behavior: right-hand Preview renders exactly what a chosen invitee or a non-invited member would see (consequence checklist with warning lines in amber, plus tabbed mock of the space, invite email and notifications) and switches from 'Matches your saved settings' to 'Includes your unsaved changes'. Changing a setting adds a 'Changed' badge, a 'CURRENT' tag on the old value, a dot on the jump-nav chip, and swaps the header CTA for '1 unsaved change · Discard · Review & save', which opens a 'Review before saving' modal with a before/after table and per-person impacts (live only, not in capture). Chip-row 'Jump to section' nav proposed as new entry section-jump-nav. Avatar stack '+12' for invitees."
